ConflictEvidenceRole.description:
The three immutable evidence roles the verified-read boundary streams.

``CANDIDATE`` exists only while the conflict retains a content candidate;
a delete conflict has no candidate bytes and the reader fails closed.

DeviceGrantRequest.description:
The strict unauthenticated plugin grant-creation body (spec 11.1).

``client_instance_id`` is the non-secret UUID the plugin generated once;
``claimed_device_id`` optionally carries one prior non-secret device id.
